# Update README on Changes

When making changes to any of the following, update `README.md` to reflect them:

- **Parser patterns** (`app/parsers/parser_utils.py`, `app/parsers/initial_parser.py`, `app/parsers/update_parser.py`) — update the "Live Thread Updates" section with new or modified formats
- **Environment variables** (`app/config/settings.py`) — update the "Environment Variables" table
- **Slack commands or event handlers** (`app/slack/commands.py`) — update "Flow" or "Slash Command Configuration"
- **OCR providers** (`app/ocr/`) — update the "OCR Providers" table
- **Architecture changes** (new modules, renamed files) — update the "Architecture" tree
- **Release summary format** (`app/slack/formatter.py`) — update the "Release Summary Format" example
